    <title>EP11《吴川是个黄女孩》：姐姐 我可以为你犯罪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6773c9225fb4ebc78abc1f65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6773c9225fb4ebc78abc1f65</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 10:01:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“我的右手软下来。我为有生以来头次听到的这声“姐”酥了半边，居然鼻子也酸了。…… 得承认我也有颗容易被收买的心。我头晕眼花地醉在那一声“姐”里。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我迷恋这个亚洲女孩，因为她身上有我。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“有时在她那儿一块吃点心，我情不自禁喝掉果汁瓶里的底子，或者吃下糕饼盒里的碎渣，都会突然发现她在盯着我，眼神既不解又鄙夷：这些自然顺畅的贫贱动作是怎样来的？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span><a href="https://www.99csw.com/book/1250/329644.htm" data-url="https://www.99csw.com/book/1250/329644.htm"><span>《吴川是个黄女孩》</span></a></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以跳着听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 茹比的床究竟被谁占据了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 尝试概括“我”和吴川的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> “我”逃开茹比 急迫奔向吴川</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 姊妹相认：“我”观察与伏击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> “也”的破绽：意识没有觉察 语言却出卖了她</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 姐妹关系的复杂性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 饮食也是有阶级的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 第一人称叙述者不可靠：“我”在自己的猜测中受了伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 双重叙事框架：现实与创伤记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a>&nbsp; 消费成为情感表达的替代物：爱=花钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 吴川的身体：对完整的身体不耐烦 主动打孔 染上性病也无所谓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1866">31:06</a> “我”的身体：儿时被烫伤的前胸 成年做服务的右手和遭受暴力的身体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 姊妹情感高潮：我愿意为你犯罪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a> 无奖竞猜：吴川为什么叫吴川 “川”有什么意涵&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>来听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4"><span>⁠Apple Podcasts⁠</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md"><span>⁠Spotify⁠</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQIARAN" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQIARAN"><span>⁠GooglePodcasts⁠</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60c72c69214b5c85614653b7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60c72c69214b5c85614653b7"><span>⁠小宇宙App⁠</span></a><span>或任意泛用型播客客户端通过⁠rss⁠：<a data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/7b8be4a0/podcast/rss" href="https://anchor.fm/s/7b8be4a0/podcast/rss">anchor.fm</a>订阅收听《胡子有脸》</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>找我</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>huhufm@yeah.net</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>给脸友们的话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你好喜欢好喜欢这期节目，想要支持我继续做下去，请多多与我互动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱要大声说出来，疑惑和批评也欢迎。</span></p>]]></description>
