  <item>
    <title>EP10《吴川是个黄女孩》直女：拉拉不要爱上我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6769ff39e8bf529c3e7c67ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6769ff39e8bf529c3e7c67ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 23:58:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“茹比在郊区上班，常常采一把野花放在我家门口。她知道我们之间的无望，不过她总得有个人可以让她为其采采花。尤其是为采花她必须犯法。牺牲意识让茹比感到古典。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“感情在她自身常常是供她出洋相的——比如采野花、唱小夜曲之类，她却对难以言传的感情逻辑有着神算，得数无非那么几个。也许因为她的英明预见，所以她从不真正开展任何感情。”</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以跳着听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 叙述者“我”的多重身份：以按摩师为职业掩护的性工作者/被抛弃的女儿/在美华人移民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>【茹比是谁】：40岁的艺术学院旁听生/"她是同性恋”/我急切地要找个男人搭伙过活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 【茹比的花】：她在郊区上班，常常采一把野花放在我家门口。她总得有个人可以让她为其采采花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 【食堂事件】：她找上来要我伤害她，我有什么办法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">17:43</a> 【茹比的床】：我在发现茹比的性倾向之后从不冒风险让她过夜，栓上门也不行。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 【CD事件】：我怕一个人待在公寓，我必须利用茹比对我的单方面柔情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 【茹比的功能性】：“我”时不时的情感支撑；作者引出真正主角的必要配角</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4"><span>Apple Podcasts</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQIARAN" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQ