  <item>
    <title>EP8 金惠珍《关于女儿》：我生活西化的女儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c79d21312d1e4e61cdfc50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c79d21312d1e4e61cdfc50</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Jul 2023 11:08:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>也许是让女儿读了太多的书了。我这样想着，学着学着学了些不需要学的，学了些不应该学到的东西。拒绝世界的方法，与世界不相容的方法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>어쩌면 딸애는 공부를 지나치게 많이 했는지도 모른다. 배우고 배우다가 배울 필요가 없는 것, 배우지 말아야 할 것까지 배워 버린 거라고 나는 생각한다. 세계를 거부하는 법. 세계와 불화하는 법.</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】huhu</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】雪雨 《关于女儿》策划编辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】小鱼 《关于女儿》营销编辑</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以跳着听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 书不该因为某些原因舍弃掉最契合的读者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 书背后的故事：插画、设计、纸张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 以母亲的视角书写同性恋女儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 没完没了寂寥的独居母亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a> 金钱变成了母女关系制衡的工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> 失势和年迈导致母亲的衰弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> 女儿有了知识就会背叛整个家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a> 虚弱的男人和没有名字的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a> 从夏季、家庭姓名和恋人昵称说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">01:01:32</a> 母亲从失能的珍身上看到了女儿晚年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4193">01:09:53</a> 多管闲事——母女的相似性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">01:01:32</a>&nbsp; 珍和女儿的恋人也是“我”的女儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">01:17:00</a> 家的组成要素是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5667">01:34:27</a> 故事没有确定的结局 未来会怎样？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/%E8%83%A1%E5%AD%90%E6%9C%89%E8%84%B8/id1572255887?uo=4"><span>Apple Podcasts</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/3cHU0wjvq6iuG5mkJWg7md"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQIARAN" data-url="https://podcasts.google.com/feed/aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy83YjhiZTRhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw?sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGyNavjLmAAxW0h44IHZiMAHUQ9sEGegQIARAN"><span>Google Podcasts</span></a><span>、小宇宙App或任意泛用型播客客户端订阅收听《胡子有脸》</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>huhufm@yeah.net</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>给脸友们的话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你好喜欢好喜欢这期节目，想要支持我继续做下去。可以通过爱发电打赏，更希望你能在评论区留下痕迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱要大声说出来，疑惑和批评也欢迎！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头《Harvest in BC》/片尾《Authentic Errors》&nbsp; &nbsp; 雪莲</span></p>]]></description>
