  <item>
    <title>EP6 全球化专题｜八九十年代大陆同志空间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627cc4a7362406f98269cb53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">627cc4a7362406f98269cb53</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 May 2022 07:55:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目会不时穿插中央电视台《新闻调查》栏目在2005年8月8日播放的节目《以生命的名义》。提醒我和我们，我们曾经在大陆主流媒体听过这样自由的声音，尽管非常短暂。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以跳着听</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> &nbsp;现代语境下的“同志”是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> “同志”的政治色彩：Call Me By Your Name😉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> &nbsp;当我在在百度上搜索“同志” 北师大性教育课题组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> &nbsp;八九十年代的文化背景：从娄烨《周末情人》说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> &nbsp;反实用主义 打开性在文学和公众层面的禁忌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> &nbsp;被阉割与消失的文艺作品：《霸王别姬》与&lt;대도시의 사랑법&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> &nbsp;王小波《东宫西宫》：男同志的公厕、浴池与鸟洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> &nbsp;男同志困境：以让渡健康安全的方式换取身份的安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> &nbsp;林白《回廊之椅》：女同志的学校、闺房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> &nbsp;女同的寄居空间狭小且由外界被迫推动 男同志空间则主动聚集向外拓展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> &nbsp;女人和女同的双重弱势身份：爱情被轻率地解释为女性友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> &nbsp;张北川教授的希冀：希望我们都在一起，能笑着谈这个问题，希望看到这不再是一个问题了。有那么一天，肯定会实现的。我们欣赏彼此的选择，爱得到了尊重，我想那是非常美丽的时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 要说！要记录！ ：主流历史由上而下施展压力 公众历史由下而上抵抗起来</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还想多了解</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av46335563/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/av46335563/"><span>中央电视台《新闻调查》：《以生命的名义》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NSPgE8Er3fYAHW5P5GGosQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NSPgE8Er3fYAHW5P5GGosQ"><span>一个老年「同志」的自述：活到 35 岁，我才知道自己是同性恋｜故事FM</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60dd643e82b7520df00265a5?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60dd643e82b7520df00265a5?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9"><span>伤痕年代的女同小说｜胡子有脸：EP2李晶李盈《沉雪》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/605aba3b22311a69e757285a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/605aba3b22311a69e757285a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9"><span>北师大性教育课题组刘文利教授参与的播客节目 ｜ 随机波动</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s34y1s7gY?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s34y1s7gY?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>北一女中嘉宾｜康熙来了</span></a></p>]]></description>
