    <itunes:duration>00:42:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/60c72c69214b5c85614653b7/Fv-mkB-WHJN9ZlhovwGljdBFt-St.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP5 卡门•玛丽亚•马查多《派对恐惧症》：海洋是拉拉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62287f9afb33eaa618fa0a50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62287f9afb33eaa618fa0a50</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Mar 2022 10:00:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>可以跳着听</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 各自对书的第一印象：“宗教徒式狂热” vs “作者很松弛甚至散漫，故事很难获得”</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 由拼贴罗列的写法想到乌力波及法国新小说</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 糟糕的母亲：是否社会原本对“母亲”期待就过于严苛</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> Husband Stitch的身体意涵：丈夫要求医生为产妇阴道多缝合一针，从而增强性快感。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 女人的身体成为容器，要在生产时扩张得能生下孩子，还要在性爱时收缩得能容纳男性生殖器。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">44:33</a> 第四爱？性格特征不等于性别特征</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> 小括号的使用：对读者的邀请/舞台提示/作者身份的强势显现——请按照我的规则读我的故事</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>还想多了解</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://carmenmariamachado.com/interviews" data-url="https://carmenmariamachado.com/interviews"><span>Carmen Maria Machado英文采访合集</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ukoQy0ge89xoHUptInUWGQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ukoQy0ge89xoHUptInUWGQ"><span>三联生活周刊专访</span></a><span>: 性是我们能发生的最具人性的行为之一</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://link.zhubai.love/api/link?subscription_type=wechat&amp;subscriber_id=2087995560514371584&amp;post_id=2107349815846760448&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.okjike.com%2ForiginalPost%2F620b0cdc17f76d001002bb5d" data-url="https://link.zhubai.love/api/link?subscription_type=wechat&amp;subscriber_id=2087995560514371584&amp;post_id=2107349815846760448&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.okjike.com%2ForiginalPost%2F620b0cdc17f76d001002bb5d"><span>落日间提到的卡牌桌游</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于跨性别者的身份认同｜</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6100fae1a69ada167c1b30fc?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6100fae1a69ada167c1b30fc?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmMGM2ZmE0YjBiZDE0MjdiZDE4ODkxOCJ9"><span>胡子有脸：EP3吴继文《天河撩乱》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>“老公针”的医学角度：</span><a href="https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/husband-stitch" data-url="https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/husband-stitch"><span><husband stitch:="" myths="" and="" facts=""> by Valinda Riggins Nwadike</husband></span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.health.com/condition/pregnancy/what-is-a-husband-stitch" data-url="https://www.health.com/condition/pregnancy/what-is-a-husband-stitch"><span>What Is a 'Husband Stitch'? Ob-Gyns Weigh in on the Problematic Procedure</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>“老公针”的社会视角：</span><a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/pax95m/the-husband-stitch-real-stories-episiotomy" data-url="https://www.vice.com/en/article/pax95m/the-husband-stitch-real-stories-episiotomy"><span>The 'Husband Stitch' Leaves Women in Pain and Without Answers</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.healthline.com/health-news/husband-stitch-is-not-just-myth" data-url="https://www.healthline.com/health-news/husband-stitch-is-not-just-myth"><span>The Husband Stitch Isn’t Just a Horrifying Childbirth Myth</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>除主播外另一位说话的人</span></strong><span>：雪某</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你好喜欢好喜欢这期节目，想要</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@huhufm" data-url="https://afdian.net/@huhufm"><span>支持</span></a><span>。不喜欢也没关系，欢迎在评论区探讨。爱要大声说出来，疑惑和批评也可以！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p>]]></description>
